 payments provided under one-time benefit arrangements related to restructuring activities are accounted for in accordance with ASC 420 and are recognized when the Company has communicated the termination plan to the affected employees, the benefits are fixed or determinable, and the Company does not have the ability to withdraw the offer. To the extent employees are required to render future service beyond a minimum retention period, severance costs are recognized ratably over the future service period as restructuring related costs. Contractual termination costs, including facility exit","context":"(1)Impairments are net of cash receipts.","section":"Item 8. Financial Statements and Supplementary Data","block":1862,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001770450-26-000009","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-03-17","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001770450","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1770450/000177045026000009/xrx-20251231.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/e14f2890e4531e2b7b8f862a879b864f84ca273ad2c88105b1aa383d25932aa3.bin","sha256":"e14f2890e4531e2b7b8f862a879b864f84ca273ad2c88105b1aa383d25932aa3"}},{"id":"26f0d960b3f941e46986e887da9b5b1caf2de75f15720e3815cc176d1d93784a","quote":"| | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | Year Ended December 31, | | 2025 | | 2024 | | 2023 Retention-related severance/bonuses(1) | | $ | — | | | $ | (2) | | | $ | (2) | Contractual severance costs | | (1) | | | (1) | | | — | Consulting and other costs(2) | | — | | | 28 | | | 23 | Total | | $ | (1) | | | $ | 25 | | | $ | 21 |","context":"In connection with our restructuring programs, we also incurred certain related costs as follows:","section":"Item 8. Financial Statements and Supplementary Data","block":1892,"table":" |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  | \n |  | Year Ended December 31,\n |  | 2025 |  | 2024 |  | 2023\nRetention-related severance/bonuses(1) |  |